{
  "key": 32474,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "Route209LostTower5F_Text_DontBeShyTakeIt",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh! The fog is gone and, with it, all\n",
        "doubt in my heart!\r",
        "This is my thanks.\n",
        "Don’t be shy! Take it!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Oh! Le brouillard s’est envolé, et tous\n",
        "mes doutes avec lui!\r",
        "Tiens, pour te remercier.\n",
        "Prends, ne sois pas timide!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route209LostTower5F_Text_FantinaIsARegularVisitor",
      "en_US": [
        "That Fantina...\n",
        "It’s hard to tell what she’s thinking.\r",
        "But she has a compassionate heart.\n",
        "You know, she’s a regular visitor."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Cette Kiméra...\n",
        "Difficile de savoir ce qu’elle pense.\r",
        "Mais elle a bon cœur, en tout cas.\n",
        "Elle vient régulièrement."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route209LostTower5F_Text_ThisFogObscuresEverything",
      "en_US": [
        "I can’t see!\n",
        "This fog obscures everything!\r",
        "I wish this fog could be blown away like\n",
        "the doubt in my heart!"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Je n’y vois rien!\n",
        "Le brouillard est si épais!\r",
        "Si seulement ce brouillard pouvait\n",
        "s’envoler et mes doutes avec lui!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route209LostTower5F_Text_TakeThis",
      "en_US": [
        "Let me make your journey out of this\n",
        "place less frightening. Take this.\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Laisse-moi t’aider à sortir de cet\n",
        "endroit sans encombre. Prends ceci.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route209LostTower5F_Text_PokemonFindSolaceHere",
      "en_US": [
        "The Lost Tower is where the spirits\n",
        "of departed Pokémon are put to rest.\r",
        "Those that enjoyed long lives...\n",
        "Those whose times were short...\r",
        "All the departed Pokémon shall find\n",
        "solace here..."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "C’est à la Tour Perdue que reposent\n",
        "les âmes des Pokémon disparus.\r",
        "Ceux qui ont vécu longtemps...\n",
        "Ceux dont la vie a été courte...\r",
        "Tous peuvent trouver le repos ici..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route209LostTower5F_Text_ThisFogObscuresEverything2",
      "en_US": [
        "I can’t see!\n",
        "This fog obscures everything!\r",
        "I wish this fog could be blown away like\n",
        "the doubt in my heart!"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Je n’y vois rien!\n",
        "Le brouillard est si épais!\r",
        "Si seulement ce brouillard pouvait\n",
        "s’envoler et mes doutes avec lui!"
      ]
    }
  ]
